neutronSpectrum_Ti.txt: approximate Ti muon-capture neutron kinetic-energy spectrum (shape only).
(No header inside the .txt: Mu2eUtilities loadTable does not skip comment lines.)
Source: AlCap neutron thesis, D. Alexander (Houston 2018), Mu2e DocDB 38414: thermal A*E^(5/11)*exp(-E/1.59)
plus direct B*exp(-E/7.45) (Table 7.2, MeV). The thesis gives the shapes but not A/B; ASSUMPTION: the two
components are equal at 5.5 MeV (middle of the gap between the 2-5 and 6-10 MeV fit windows).
Same format as neutronSpectrum.txt: 200 bins of 0.5 MeV, bin centres 0.25-99.75, kinetic energy, values
normalized to sum 1; use with spectrumVariable kineticEnergy and BinCenter true.
Rate: physicsParams.Ti.capture.neutronRate (0.90, see globalConstants_01.txt).
Generated by MultiTarget/upstream_conv/scripts/ti_neutron_photon_spectra.py.
